			<div class="page-header__main">
				<h1>How to Apply for Funding</h1>

									<div class="entry-content">
						<p>This page explains our grant evaluation process and lists opportunities to apply for funding from our programs.</p>
					</div>
				
							</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

